{
 "daf": "22b",
 "kbVersion": "sha256-49d49c71db8fb5d4",
 "sentences": {
  "1": {
   "segId": "Megillah.22b.2",
   "sugya": "megillah_22a_taanit_tzibur_bekama",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "support",
     "object": "s_ts_bitul_melacha",
     "kind": "ta_shema",
     "gloss_en": "תא שמע: זה הכלל, כל שיש בו ביטול מלאכה לעם כגון תענית צבור ותשעה באב קורין שלשה ... שמע מינה",
     "supports": "p_taanit_shlosha",
     "status": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_baraita_bitul_shlosha",
     "gloss_en": "this is the rule: any day on which there is loss of work for the people, such as a public fast and the Ninth of Av -- three read"
    }
   ]
  },
  "3": {
   "segId": "Megillah.22b.4",
   "sugya": "megillah_22a_taanit_tzibur_bekama",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "support",
     "object": "s_ashi_leatuyei_mai",
     "kind": "dika_nami",
     "gloss_en": "לאתויי מאי? לאו לאתויי תענית צבור ותשעה באב -- so on a public fast four read",
     "supports": "p_taanit_arba",
     "status": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection",
     "object": "obj_ashi_tnan",
     "kind": "tnan",
     "gloss_en": "והא אנן לא תנן הכי: זה הכלל, כל יום שיש בו מוסף ואינו יום טוב קורין ארבעה -- לאתויי מאי? לאו לאתויי תענית צבור ותשעה באב!",
     "against": "p_taanit_shlosha",
     "state": "answered"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_ashi_klal_leatuyei_taanit",
     "gloss_en": "Rav Ashi: what does the mishna's klal add? does it not add the public fast and the Ninth of Av?"
    }
   ]
  },
  "8": {
   "segId": "Megillah.22b.9",
   "sugya": "megillah_22a_taanit_tzibur_bekama",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "support",
     "object": "s_halachach_rc",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "הלכך בראש חודש ומועד דאיכא קרבן מוסף -- ארבעה",
     "supports": "p_rc_arba_musaf",
     "status": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "support",
     "object": "s_halachach_yt",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "ביום טוב דאסור בעשיית מלאכה -- חמשה",
     "supports": "p_yt_chamisha_melacha",
     "status": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "support",
     "object": "s_halachach_yk",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "ביום הכפורים דענוש כרת -- ששה",
     "supports": "p_yk_shisha_karet",
     "status": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "support",
     "object": "s_halachach_shabbat",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "שבת דאיכא איסור סקילה -- שבעה",
     "supports": "p_shabbat_shiva_skila",
     "status": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_rc_arba_musaf",
     "gloss_en": "therefore on Rosh Chodesh and Moed, where there is a musaf offering -- four read"
    }
   ]
  },
  "7": {
   "segId": "Megillah.22b.8",
   "sugya": "megillah_22a_taanit_tzibur_bekama",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "support",
     "object": "s_simana_tafei",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "אלא נקוט האי כללא בידך -- the mnemonic's content",
     "supports": "p_klal_simana",
     "status": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection_answer",
     "object": "a_simana_beolma",
     "gloss_en": "סימנא בעלמא יהיב -- the klal adds no day; it gives a mnemonic (= p_klal_simana). Reached after ואלא קשיא זה הכלל! לא, לאתויי ר״ח ומועד (22b.6) was refuted by הא בהדיא קתני לה (22b.7)",
     "answers": "obj_ashi_tnan",
     "restores": "p_taanit_shlosha"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_klal_simana",
     "gloss_en": "it gives a mere mnemonic, lest you say that Yom Tov and Chol HaMoed are alike"
    }
   ]
  },
  "10": {
   "segId": "Megillah.22b.11",
   "sugya": "megillah_22a_taanit_tzibur_bekama",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "support",
     "object": "s_vetanya_even_maskit",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "ותניא: ואבן משכית ... עליה אי אתה משתחוה בארצכם (no support kind names ותניא; svara)",
     "supports": "p_ritzpa_avanim",
     "status": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "support",
     "object": "s_kedeulla_ritzpa",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "כדעולא, דאמר עולא: לא אסרה תורה אלא רצפה של אבנים בלבד",
     "supports": "p_ritzpa_avanim",
     "status": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_ritzpa_avanim",
     "gloss_en": "[the reason Rav did not fall on his face:] it was a stone floor"
    }
   ]
  },
  "12": {
   "segId": "Megillah.22b.13",
   "sugya": "megillah_22a_taanit_tzibur_bekama",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "support",
     "object": "s_kedeulla_pishut",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "וכדעולא, דאמר עולא: לא אסרה תורה אלא פישוט ידים ורגלים בלבד",
     "supports": "p_rav_pishut",
     "status": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection",
     "object": "obj_leizil_letzibura",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "וליזיל לגבי ציבורא ולינפול על אפיה!",
     "against": "p_ritzpa_avanim",
     "state": "answered"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection_answer",
     "object": "a_lo_baei_matrach",
     "gloss_en": "לא בעי למיטרח ציבורא",
     "answers": "obj_leizil_letzibura",
     "restores": "p_ritzpa_avanim"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_rav_pishut",
     "gloss_en": "and if you wish say: Rav would do [full] spreading of hands and feet"
    }
   ]
  },
  "14": {
   "segId": "Megillah.22b.15",
   "sugya": "megillah_22a_taanit_tzibur_bekama",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "support",
     "object": "s_kedrabbi_elazar",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "כדרבי אלעזר",
     "supports": "p_adam_chashuv_shani",
     "status": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "support",
     "object": "s_dichtiv_kum_lach",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "דכתיב: ויאמר ה' אל יהושע קום לך -- R' Elazar's own verse",
     "supports": "p_elazar_adam_chashuv",
     "status": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_adam_chashuv_shani",
     "gloss_en": "and if you wish say: an important person is different"
    }
   ]
  },
  "15": {
